1d:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"在十个冻结的研究任务中，给 Agent 固定开发时间与计算资源修改训练算法；随后从头重跑候选，由 Agent 不可见的固定 evaluator 打分。不同任务指标被映射到同一归一化尺度后再汇总比较。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"原文给 Agent 四小时和一块 B300 修改固定研究仓库。提交后仅源码保留；八个训练任务重新训练，两个非训练任务直接执行产生模型，最终由固定评分器检查。训练任务的验证阶段上限为十二小时。这里是原文协议说明，非一周复现所需的最低资源配置。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"各任务先用单调变换 φ 统一“越大越好”的方向，再分段映射：无信息模型对应 0，原算法对应 0.1，任务最优参考对应 1。原算法以上的进度占 0.9 区间。这是一项人为设计的可比坐标，不能将平均 0.2 解释成完成了 20% 的通用智能。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"If φ(x) ≤ φ_b: score = 0.1·(φ(x)−φ_⊥)/(φ_b−φ_⊥)\nOtherwise: score = 0.1 + 0.9·(φ(x)−φ_b)/(φ*−φ_b)"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"φ(x) 表示把指标方向统一后的候选表现；φ_⊥、φ_b、φ* 分别是归一化的底部、基准与目标锚点。公式把不同任务的原始指标放到共同刻度：代入 φ_b，前后两段都得到 0.1；代入 φ*，第二段得到 1。两段斜率不同，因此同样的原始指标变化可能带来不同的分数变化。解释结果时要先回到具体任务的原始指标与资源预算。这里列出主要映射，实际无效提交与边界处理应按 Benchmark 实现检查。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：Agent 是否能提出可重跑的算法改动？→ Experiment：在十个冻结仓库、多种系统配置下提交源码，统一重新执行并按隐藏最终评价比较基线。→ Answer：作者报告部分算法改进与明显任务差异。原文明确 Proxy 与最终评估是访问和时间隔离，部分任务可能使用同一语料，不能称为完全 Sample-disjoint。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"摘要报告六种系统共 29 个配置的平均归一化分数为 0.166，最好系统为 0.250；原算法在该尺度上为 0.1。这里是论文定义的归一化得分，不是准确率，也不是已经实现 recursive optimization 的比例。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"源码重跑与冻结评价器提高了结果可审查性。Benchmark 测的是算法设计能力；要证明 RSI，还需要把改进算法用于产生后继研究者，并测它下一轮的能力。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是任务规范能把真正算法变化与执行层捷径区分开。相同源码在固定硬件上的收益，仍可能来自特定算子或 Proxy 适配。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"一次算法设计评测不包含改进后的 model 成为下一代研究者的完整闭环。固定任务与归一化尺度的选择影响汇总解释，search 预算也限制结论范围；此条目核验摘要，未审计全部提交或复现训练。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: AI4AI-Bench: Benchmarking LLM Agents in Algorithmic Design for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：选小型分类仓库，冻结数据、训练预算和最终评分。Day 3–5：允许 Agent 只改 Objective 或 Update Rule，源码提交后从零训练。Day 6–7：多种子与第二数据分布重跑，并对代码逐项审计。只验证协议，不复刻 B300 全套规模。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"让 Proxy 奖励早期收敛，最终任务需要更长训练保持泛化。若 Agent 的改动只改善前几步而降低最终结果，就能检验 Proxy 对算法质量的误导。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-prior","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-prior","children":"Prior Work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"后续相关工作 HyperAgents 已研究可编辑 Meta-Agent，并用受控的 Improvement@k 比较产生更好后继的能力。因此，仅增加 Improver 评测不足以支撑新颖性。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2603.19461v1",{"href":"#reference-2603.19461v1","aria-label":"来源 4: HyperAgents","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究算法改进的可继承性：用发现的 Update Rule 训练小型研究 Agent，再在全新算法设计任务上比较其后继提案。相对 RE-Bench 的一次研发产物评价，这直接测闭环中的能力传递。关键是固定下一轮搜索预算与起始任务，避免把一次更好的模型分数当作更强研发能力。 相对 HyperAgents，待检验的缺口是改进机制在何种条件下可分解、移植与继承；需要同起点、同预算的组件交叉实验，识别机制作用及交互项。这个缺口尚未完成穷尽式检索，不能宣称已确认 Novelty。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2410.07095",{"href":"#reference-2410.07095","aria-label":"来源 2: MLE-bench: Evaluating Machine Learning Agents on Machine Learning Engineering","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2411.15114",{"href":"#reference-2411.15114","aria-label":"来源 3: RE-Bench: Evaluating frontier AI R&D capabilities of language model agents against human experts","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2603.19461v1",{"href":"#reference-2603.19461v1","aria-label":"来源 4: HyperAgents","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
